    U -->|merkleize| K[Merkleized checkpoint / root and ancestry]
    K -->|valid canonical range only| D[DatabaseSet / ManagedDb adapter]
    subgraph Q[Any keyed DB: illustration]
        I[Current key index: key to latest op location]
